  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-20">
        <div data-aos="fade-right">
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Our Story</h2>
          <div class="prose dark:prose-invert text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            <p class="mb-4">The One Group started with a simple observation: most AI "solutions" are just demos. They look impressive in a sales pitch, but fall apart in the real world.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">We saw SMB owners getting burned by over-promised AI tools that required teams of engineers to maintain. The barrier to entry was too high. The complexity was too much.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">So we built something different.</p>
            <p>We focus on <strong>practical AI</strong> — systems that work on day one, improve over time, and don't require a PhD to manage. Our agents learn your business, adapt to your workflow, and actually deliver ROI.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-left" class="relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 gradient-bg opacity-20 blur-3xl rounded-full"></div>
          <div class="relative bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg">
                <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold gradient-text mb-1">12+</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">SMBs Automated</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg">
                <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold gradient-text mb-1">500+</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Hours Saved</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg">
                <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold gradient-text mb-1">$2M+</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Revenue Generated</div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg">
                <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold gradient-text mb-1">7-day</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Avg. Deployment</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

