          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">How We Work: The 8-Agent System</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">We drink our own champagne. Our business runs on OpenClaw — 8 AI agents working 24/7. Full transparency on how we operate.</p>
