            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded-full font-medium">24/7 Operations</span>
            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded-full font-medium">$150/month cost</span>
